{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0252_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9fb412df5609c8c76edc0d1d18a7a904653ce1126da1d78eae685e2fb6f2b532", "ja": "（ふぅ……今日は座って事務仕事ばかり\nしてたけど、結構疲れたな……）", "zh": "（呼……今天一直坐着处理文书工作，虽然没怎么动，但还真挺累的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0252_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "bc33c4b00491d7adaf1e40b4144ca99c045ce031dac56277238e91dcde6f2d74", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　いま、暑いなって\n思ったり、汗をかいたりしてないですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！现在有没有觉得热，或者出汗呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0252_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ccd4b30338335481804db81aceb8e262064e834770ecbafe9065e5a208bbb977", "ja": "星梨花？　お疲れさま。\nまあ……そうだな、少し汗っぽいかもしれない。", "zh": "星梨花？辛苦了。嗯……确实，可能稍微出了点汗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0252_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "236267dc0943d4d477f18de640db6f4ff8fe9ce38dab27eeff40ffcb22e96801", "ja": "えへへ、だったらわたしに任せてください！\nいいもの持ってきたんですよ♪　えっと……あった！", "zh": "嘿嘿，那就交给我吧！\n我带来了好东西哦♪　呃……找到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0252_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "4ed8362e972f927308b9a059083ce2a6fe59504fc3d5e2ec2a07b00db09194d6", "ja": "これです！　携帯用のミストなんです。\n小さくても、びっくりするくらい涼しいんですよ。", "zh": "就是这个！是便携式喷雾器。\n虽然很小，但凉快得让人惊讶哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0252_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2f5091e7eeb8fabce4667002bc777487bfa5ebc5d33dd2259242e1e3ad6ce2e6", "ja": "へえ、貸してくれるのか？　ありがとう。", "zh": "哦，愿意借给我吗？谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0252_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "4dae2262841afe7960af3eec3126fd78a507522ab880f9665276bee4d392e0a8", "ja": "あ……でも、結構しゅーって出ますから、\nかなり濡れちゃうかも……大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "啊……不过水会“咻——”地喷出来，可能会弄得很湿……您没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0252_1007_p", "source_sha256": "adc2aa2f6285b182415d499c022a2fb810e7cb3f6bc8eb9db7a7c22bcaeb3fd1", "ja": "そうか……だったら外に出ようかな？\n丁度息抜きしようと思ってたところだったし。", "zh": "这样啊……那要不要去外面？我正好也想出去透透气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0252_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "ed2a1264337b2506c3182a7e8a7fff26343046b08453c756f9959f658c4592d4", "ja": "はい、外の方が気持ちいいですよ！\nわたしがしゅーってしてあげますから、行きましょう♪", "zh": "嗯，外面更舒服哦！\n我会让您凉快凉快的，我们走吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0252_1009_p", "source_sha256": "60e94dea74dddf7c2c98c6a1b5861188420afcf02890094db5b5b64a219c15f1", "ja": "（しばらく外で、星梨花と涼しく遊んだ。\nおかげで、いいリフレッシュができたな！）", "zh": "（在外面和星梨花凉快地玩了一会儿。多亏了她，真是好好放松了一下！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
